#api http test requests for VsCode REST Client

###get cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

###get cats by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

###post new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Princess Donut",
  "birthdate": "2020-01-01",
  "Weight": 4.5,
  "owner": "Carl",
  "image": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dungeon-crawler-carl/images/5/56/Donut_by_Mashermello.png/revision/latest?cb=20251024191920"
}
